    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just stress though. it's like... i look at my hands and they don't even feel like they belong to me. everything is just screens and notifications. i feel like a ghost in a machine that's already broken. it would be so much easier to just... stop the program. to just exit. it's like there's nothing left to save.",
