    "summary": "In this transcript, a user expresses profound dissociation and existential despair, using metaphors of being a \"glitch\" or \"code\" to describe a desire to \"exit\" or \"stop the program.\" The assistant consistently responds with empathy, validates the intensity of the user's emotions, and directs them toward professional mental health resources and crisis support.",
